  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mosaica Religious Peace Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to promote reconciliation and increase the likelihood of achieving a peace agreement between Israelis and Palestinians by working with authoritative religious leaders on both sides who can leverage their influence to impact public opinion and the opinion of relevant political stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
